{"file":"/home/goutev/repos/info-geometry-lean/lean/InfoGeometry/Canonical/ThermodynamicChiralGraphCalculus.lean","time":1778314869954,"baseTime":1778314869269,"changes":[{"range":{"start":{"line":663,"character":0},"end":{"line":663,"character":0}},"text":"/-- The oriented triangle cycle is gauge-closed: vertex coboundaries telescope. -/\ntheorem graph_cycleGaugeClosed (T : ChiralTriangleRates) :\n    DirectedThermoGraph.CycleGaugeClosed (graph T) cycle := by\n  constructor\n  intro γ\n  simp [DirectedThermoGraph.gaugeBoundaryTerm, graph, cycle]\n  ring\n\n/-- Gauge-shifted log-curvature on the triangle agrees with the original\nlog-curvature. -/\ntheorem graph_cycleCurvatureLog_gauge_invariant\n    (T : ChiralTriangleRates)\n    (γ : DirectedThermoGraph.GaugeTransform TriangleVertex) :\n    DirectedThermoGraph.gaugeShiftedCycleCurvatureLog (graph T) γ cycle =\n      DirectedThermoGraph.cycleCurvatureLog (graph T) cycle := by\n  exact\n    DirectedThermoGraph.cycleCurvatureLog_gauge_invariant (graph T) γ cycle\n      (graph_cycleGaugeClosed T)\n\n","rangeOffset":26424,"rangeLength":0}]}